            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Resonators for use in a transcutaneous energy transfer system (TETS) are provided. A resonator includes a housing, a magnetic core positioned within the housing, the magnetic core defining an annular groove and a central aperture, a coil element positioned within the annular groove, and at least one layer positioned within the central aperture, the at least one layer comprising a non-magnetic, non-metallic material.</p>
